node_modules/
*.log
# Gutenberg source etexts are fetched by tools/fetch_extras.sh, not vendored
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# Playwright and its browser, installed by tools/test.sh on first run
tests/node_modules/
# The single-file offline build: 13 MB, regenerated by tools/build.sh from
# committed data, and served by the deploy rather than stored here.
docs/the-book.html
# The crawlable pages: one per work and one per chapter, 2,709 files
# regenerated by tools/build_pages.py whenever the text changes, and served
# by the deploy rather than stored here -- for the same reason as the line
# above, and with more force, since these are 2,709 files rather than one.
docs/read/
docs/contents/
docs/threads/
docs/timeline/
docs/sitemap.xml
docs/robots.txt
docs/404.html
# The service worker: generated by tools/build_sw.py and stamped with a hash
# of everything it serves, so it changes whenever they do. Derived, like the
# two above, and built here and by the deploy rather than committed.
docs/sw.js

# The rendered audio and the model that makes it. Both are derived and both
# are far too large for the repository: the render is 1.79 GB of Opus and
# lives on the Internet Archive, and the Kokoro weights are a 338 MB download
# that tools/render_audio.py names the URLs for. Neither is committed.
dist/
source/voice/
